030.steps:
1.Navigate to Network->DNS Proxy,enable dns proxy ,and set 4TO4 mode
2. Navigate to Network->DNS, Fill a real ipv4 dns server as server1, then fill two fake ipv4 dns servers as server 2 and server 3;
3. Initiate a dns query from client pc and capture the packets, dns query should forward to the server1 and it should reply with the correct IP address;
4. Fill a fake dns server as server1 and server3, fill a real dns as server2, do step2 again;
5. Fill a fake dns server as server1 and server2, fill a real dns as server3, do step2 again;
6.set DNS Proxy mode to 4TO6 mode,and edit ipv6 dns server,repeat steps 2-5

